WP-54 (releasekit): before `releasekit package` runs, $(DIST)/<os>_<arch>/ holds:
- ruralzd for linux/amd64 and linux/arm64 (production) and darwin/arm64 and darwin/amd64 (development only, built by release-dry-run, not by stage 4);
- ruralz for linux/{amd64,arm64}, darwin/{arm64,amd64} and windows/amd64 (ruralz.exe, which goes in the .zip);
- ruralz-control for linux/{amd64,arm64}, which is the M2 stub and must NOT be packaged (11 req 91: no ruralz-control archive until M2).
dist/ can also hold non-platform directories (dist/bench, dist/fuzz), so package should read only <os>_<arch> directories.
